Package: ekznwr
Version: 0.0.5
Title: Data Management and GIS Utilities for Ezemvelo KZN Wildlife
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Paul",
        "Gordijn",
        email = "paul.gordijn@kznwildlife.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Tools for scanning, classifying, grouping, locating, and
    extracting organisational datasets and geospatial data archives. Includes
    support for compound GIS datasets, associated sidecar files, mount-aware
    inventories, and logical dataset summaries.
URL: https://github.com/ekznw/ekznwr
